    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32285" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκῡμ-αίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>swerve, bulge from the straight line,</i> of a line
